WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.130
- This is random and I
know you don't remember,

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.300
you should not remember this,
it was a nothing moment.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.100
When I first moved out
here after high school,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.300
I lived with a girl that
wanted to be an actor.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.201
She was like, we needed money.

00:00:13.201 --> 00:00:15.120
You know, 'cause you only
get so many singing things

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.042
and I didn't want to be an
actor, I wanted to be a singer.

00:00:17.042 --> 00:00:18.080
And (laughs)

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.830
and she was like, "You
should come do extra work."

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.250
And my very first job you were directing

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.430
the episode of Sabrina, the Teenage Witch.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.370
- I remember it really well.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.203
- [Kelly] You do not.

00:00:27.203 --> 00:00:29.040
- Yes, I do and I'll tell you why.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.860
Your girlfriend was on the show.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:31.693
- [Kelly] She was.

00:00:31.693 --> 00:00:34.391
- You were just standing there
visiting her, supporting her.

00:00:34.391 --> 00:00:36.050
- I was an extra but I
was just standing there

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.020
because I didn't know what
I was supposed to be doing.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.990
- And I want to tell you that your energy

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:43.476
was so palpable that I
literally went to the producer

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:48.476
and I said, "We have to use
this young woman in some way."

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.560
And you got to wink.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.782
- I winked and I went, I
went like this to Sabrina

00:00:52.782 --> 00:00:56.010
and I pissed off so many people that day.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.550
Because all those people that were there,

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:59.580
you know, the extras wanted to be actors.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.650
And they all knew I didn't.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.660
And you were like, "Hey
we need you to do this."

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.957
And I was like, "I'm
just pissing everyone off

00:01:04.957 --> 00:01:06.660
"over here on the left."

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.130
But I found out I got paid more

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.380
so I was like, "I will
do whatever you want."

